{"about_the_game":"Immerse yourself in an groundbreaking and fresh experience with Drag Racing 3D. Our game is the best drag racing simulator with a wide variety of tuning options. Build your own unique dream car and compete with players from all over the world.<br><br><strong>BRAND NEW AND UNIQUE</strong><br>We will show a unique and comprehensive approach to car tuning. Moreover, our team is always listening to feedback from players, and continuously improving the gameplay. Join our community and help create a dream game.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2249600/extras/4804ce877f6cf2c780619eafb8872088.poster.avif?t=1757015278\" width=600 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2249600/extras/4804ce877f6cf2c780619eafb8872088.webm?t=1757015278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2249600/extras/4804ce877f6cf2c780619eafb8872088.mp4?t=1757015278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>DEMONSTRATE YOUR SKILLS</strong><br>Strive for excellence in various game modes including Racing, Time Racing, Tournaments, and Championships. Maintain your speed and leave your rivals in the dust as you conquer the competition.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2249600/extras/f856c9072dfb4ea8fdc9243f19cc82b5.poster.avif?t=1757015278\" width=600 height=324 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2249600/extras/f856c9072dfb4ea8fdc9243f19cc82b5.webm?t=1757015278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2249600/extras/f856c9072dfb4ea8fdc9243f19cc82b5.mp4?t=1757015278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>STYLE ABOVE ALL ELSE</strong><br>Design your one-of-a-kind car with endless tuning options, various body parts, and custom liveries. Increase your car collection by acquiring more vehicles.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2249600/extras/3040a3c76425ee7d3cb0a46e28781ce3.poster.avif?t=1757015278\" width=600 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2249600/extras/3040a3c76425ee7d3cb0a46e28781ce3.webm?t=1757015278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2249600/extras/3040a3c76425ee7d3cb0a46e28781ce3.mp4?t=1757015278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>LARGE CAR PARK</strong><br>We offer a selection of more than 50 cars. Furthermore, our car list is continuously growing as we listen to community feedback and add new cars on player requests.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2249600/extras/d46f5bb4ce1ee91776b272e0a9eb22af.poster.avif?t=1757015278\" width=600 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2249600/extras/d46f5bb4ce1ee91776b272e0a9eb22af.webm?t=1757015278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2249600/extras/d46f5bb4ce1ee91776b272e0a9eb22af.mp4?t=1757015278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>TEAMED UP WITH OTHER PLAYERS</strong><br>Find friends and team up to take on challenges together and compete with other teams to prove your dominance.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2249600/extras/a34773dc3137ee84092285450fac41cd.poster.avif?t=1757015278\" width=600 height=322 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2249600/extras/a34773dc3137ee84092285450fac41cd.webm?t=1757015278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2249600/extras/a34773dc3137ee84092285450fac41cd.mp4?t=1757015278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><br><strong>THERE IS NO HONOR IN BEING POOR</strong><br>We offer numerous opportunities for players to accumulate wealth.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2249600/extras/3ca90a16cf68570f33f23adcbc2e50c5.poster.avif?t=1757015278\" width=600 height=292 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2249600/extras/3ca90a16cf68570f33f23adcbc2e50c5.webm?t=1757015278\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2249600/extras/3ca90a16cf68570f33f23adcbc2e50c5.mp4?t=1757015278\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Daily rewards: Show your commitment and dedication by collecting various rewards just by logging in.<br></li><li>Blitz &amp; Sprint: After collecting your daily rewards, take on daily tasks to earn in-game currency and experience points.<br></li><li>Flea Market: If you're looking to showcase your skills and earn reputation, sign a personalized contract at the flea market. Complete tasks and assemble cars for the owner to gain recognition.<br></li><li>Market: Set your own prices as a seller and choose what to buy as a buyer in this free market environment.</li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2249600?t=1757015278","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/a